messages.text:
Hey, hey, what have we here, boys?{be01}
You have good Pokémon.
Let me see!{be01}

Hey, hey! A bad one teamed up
with another bad one!{be01}
Do you know what it means?{be01}
That means we are very bad!{be01}

Even bad men like us
can be friends!{be01}
What a great thing!
Friendship between men{be00}
and friendship with Pokémon...
